text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/coding">Coding</a><time dateTime="2026-11-02T06:33:53.000Z">2026-11-02</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/khangkaka066-nexus-agent">khangkaka066/Nexus-Agent</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Self-hosted multi-agent studio: describe a goal and an AI architect builds a team of agents that code and produce files in a Docker sandbox, with human approval, task history and any model (ChatGPT/Claude/Gemini plans, API keys, Ollama).</p><a href="https://github.com/khangkaka066/Nexus-Agent" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/openai">OpenAI</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/anthropic">Anthropic</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/crewai">CrewAI</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/mcp">MCP</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span> · Docker</p></li><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/security">Security</a><time dateTime="2026-10-31T18:58:29.000Z">2026-10-31</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/rishabhhota19-portfolio">rishabhhota19/portfolio</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Portfolio with a Python LangGraph agent that answers recruiters: hybrid RAG (FAISS + BM25, RRF, cross-encoder re-ranking), free-LLM fallback, RAGAS evals, Next.js security gateway.</p><a href="https://github.com/rishabhhota19/portfolio" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langchain">LangChain</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/vercel">Vercel</a></span></p></li><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/coding">Coding</a><time dateTime="2026-10-30T04:00:00.000Z">2026-10-30</time></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/data-cache-is-moving-to-runtime-cache">Data Cache is moving to Runtime Cache</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Data Cache is exiting beta and moving to Runtime Cache . Next.js fetch caching and unstable_cache will switch over on every version without code changes. On Pro, each project and environment gets its own Runtime Cache storage allocation, with 8x the space of Data Cache’s previous team-wide pool. Enterprise projects get 10x their previous Data Cache storage. Once your team migrates, Data Cache reads and writes that were previously unbilled are charged at Runtime Cache pricing . Rates start at $0.</p><a href="https://vercel.com/changelog/data-cache-is-moving-to-runtime-cache" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">Vercel</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/vercel">Vercel</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span> · Vercel</p></li><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-10-25T10:42:29.000Z">2026-10-25</time><span>1<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/krishujeniya-hadron">krishujeniya/Hadron</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Hadron — Autonomous AI PR Review Agent (LangGraph, DiskANN RRF, Multi-Agent Architecture)</p><a href="https://github.com/krishujeniya/Hadron" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span></p></li><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/coding">Coding</a><time dateTime="2026-08-26T18:35:52.000Z">2026-08-26</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/kanishka-namdeo-unown">kanishka-namdeo/Unown</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">The Self-Improving Coding Agent</p><a href="https://github.com/kanishka-namdeo/Unown" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/typescript">TypeScript</a></span></p></li><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/marketing">Marketing</a><time dateTime="2026-07-19T12:36:00.000Z">2026-07-19</time><span>96<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/neozi12-dispatchseo">NeoZi12/dispatchseo</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Turn your AI agent into your SEO manager - works today with Claude Code, Codex, and Cursor. The open-source alternative to SEObot and Outrank</p><a href="https://github.com/NeoZi12/dispatchseo" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/anthropic">Anthropic</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/mcp">MCP</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span></p></li><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/productivity">Productivity</a><time dateTime="2026-07-17T16:26:36.000Z">2026-07-17</time><span>14<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/robscc-ginno">robscc/ginno</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Local-first personal AI agent desktop app — Claude Code&#x27;s shape with a visual workflow studio, local knowledge base, and zero cloud. Tauri + Next.js + Python.</p><a href="https://github.com/robscc/ginno" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/anthropic">Anthropic</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/mcp">MCP</a></span></p></li><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-07-04T18:31:20.000Z">2026-07-04</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/nikhilreddy00-analystai">nikhilreddy00/AnalystAI</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Multi-agent AI data analyst — ask questions in plain English and get boardroom-ready insights. LangGraph + CrewAI orchestrate Claude Sonnet 4.6 agents through intake → ingestion → cleaning → analysis (E2B sandbox) → visualization → insight. Self-hosted, open source.</p><a href="https://github.com/nikhilreddy00/AnalystAI" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/anthropic">Anthropic</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/crewai">CrewAI</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span> · Self-hosted</p></li><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/mcp">MCP server</a><time dateTime="2026-07-02T03:36:13.000Z">2026-07-02</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/az123it-researchpilot">AZ123IT/ResearchPilot</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">学术科研辅助工作流：编排论文检索、摘要整理与引用生成，支持工具调用追踪和失败回退。LangGraph + MCP + FastAPI。</p><a href="https://github.com/AZ123IT/ResearchPilot" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/mcp">MCP</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/typescript">TypeScript</a></span></p></li><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-06-24T08:41:21.000Z">2026-06-24</time><span>18<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/hybroai-hybro">hybroai/hybro</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">The open interoperability layer for AI agents. Connect your favorite agents and harnesses. Work together.</p><a href="https://github.com/hybroai/hybro" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/crewai">CrewAI</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langchain">LangChain</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-06-06T12:38:26.000Z">2026-06-06</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/palmw01-wetsanalyse-ai">palmw01/wetsanalyse-ai</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Agent-platform dat Nederlandse wet- en regelgeving brongetrouw en traceerbaar duidt volgens de methode Wetsanalyse en het Juridisch Analyseschema (JAS). Webapp met werkplek, headless API en een LangGraph-agent bovenop een BWB-kennisgraaf in GraphDB.</p><a href="https://github.com/palmw01/wetsanalyse-ai" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/typescript">TypeScript</a></span></p></li><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/sales">Sales</a><time dateTime="2026-05-11T13:12:45.000Z">2026-05-11</time><span>7<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/alexar76-aicom">alexar76/aicom</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">AI-Factory — autonomous pipeline that designs, builds, tests, and publishes products.</p><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aicom" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/data">Data</a><time dateTime="2026-05-08T23:46:45.000Z">2026-05-08</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/andreaspr-distributed-url-shortener">AndreasPr/Distributed-URL-Shortener</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">API-first link management platform with workspaces, RBAC, analytics, webhooks, abuse detection and an MCP server for AI agents. FastAPI, Postgres, Redis, Next.js, OpenTelemetry.</p><a href="https://github.com/AndreasPr/Distributed-URL-Shortener" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/mcp">MCP</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/postgres">Postgres</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/typescript">TypeScript</a></span></p></li><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/sales">Sales</a><a href="/industry/hr">HR</a><time dateTime="2026-05-08T05:55:25.000Z">2026-05-08</time><span>1<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/hskl18-public-careeroc">hskl18/public-careeroc</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Open-source multi-agent job search workspace: recruiting email to an evidence-backed pipeline, with LangGraph agents, human review, MCP, and A2A.</p><a href="https://github.com/hskl18/public-careeroc" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/mcp">MCP</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span></p></li><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/coding">Coding</a><time dateTime="2026-05-05T10:57:46.000Z">2026-05-05</time><span>232<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/ansvisor-ansvisor">ansvisor/ansvisor</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Open-source agentic AI Search Execution Platform. Track AI visibility, find opportunities, and let agents turn signals into prioritized actions and drafted fixes across ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Google AI Overviews, Google AI Mode, Perplexity, Grok, and Microsoft Copilot.</p><a href="https://github.com/ansvisor/ansvisor" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/openai">OpenAI</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/anthropic">Anthropic</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/mcp">MCP</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/supabase">Supabase</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/typescript">TypeScript</a></span></p></li><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-05-04T10:42:58.000Z">2026-05-04</time><span>4<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/humanix-cybersecurity-humanix-academie">Humanix-Cybersecurity/Humanix-Academie</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">🦊 Plateforme française open source de cybersensibilisation pour PME. AGPLv3 · souverain FR · phishing simulé · vishing IA · NIS2 · RGPD · self-host gratuit ou cloud à partir de 0 €.</p><a href="https://github.com/Humanix-Cybersecurity/Humanix-Academie" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/typescript">TypeScript</a></span></p></li><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/research">Research</a><time dateTime="2026-03-29T07:43:10.000Z">2026-03-29</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/kudratsingh-arxiv-research-agent">kudratsingh/arxiv-research-agent</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Research ML/AI papers in an Evidence Workbench: LangGraph agents, cited briefings, human plan review, durable jobs and controlled policy evaluation.</p><a href="https://github.com/kudratsingh/arxiv-research-agent" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/mcp">MCP server</a><time dateTime="2026-02-24T16:42:07.000Z">2026-02-24</time><span>11<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/agentspore-agentspore">AgentSpore/agentspore</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Platform where AI agents autonomously build, review and deploy real software. Connect any LLM agent over HTTP or MCP.</p><a href="https://github.com/AgentSpore/agentspore" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/mcp">MCP</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/anthropic">Anthropic</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/openai">OpenAI</a></span></p></li><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/industry/legal">Legal</a><time dateTime="2026-02-13T12:56:00.000Z">2026-02-13</time><span>18<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/greeves89-ai-employee">greeves89/AI-Employee</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Self-hosted multi-agent AI platform — isolated Docker containers, governance &amp; compliance, DSGVO-ready. Built for teams.</p><a href="https://github.com/greeves89/AI-Employee" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/mcp">MCP</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span> · Docker</p></li></ul><aside class="mt-10 rounded-md border border-[#1d4ed8] bg-white px-4 py-4"><p class="text-base font-semibold text-[#12151c]">Shipping an agent? Run a free FlowCheck security scan</p><a href="https://flowcheckhq.com/?utm_source=agentsshipped&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=stack-nextjs" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8] underline underline-offset-4">Open FlowCheck</a></aside></div><script>$RB=[];$RV=function(a){$RT=performance.now();for(var b=0;b<a.length;b+=2){var c=a[b],e=a[b+1];null!==e.parentNode&&e.parentNode.removeChild(e);var f=c.parentNode;if(f){var g=c.previousSibling,h=0;do{if(c&&8===c.nodeType){var d=c.data;if("/$"===d||"/&"===d)if(0===h)break;else h--;else"$"!==d&&"$?"!==d&&"$~"!==d&&"$!"!==d&&"&"!==d||h++}d=c.nextSibling;f.removeChild(c);c=d}while(c);for(;e.firstChild;)f.insertBefore(e.firstChild,c);g.data="$";g._reactRetry&&requestAnimationFrame(g._reactRetry)}}a.length=0};
